## Final Judgement
The fact-check found that a presidential aide explicitly denied in 2018 that any of President Buhari's daughters were on the NNPC board, and an official list of NNPC board members from October 2020 includes no daughter. The only mention of a daughter (Zahra Buhari Indimi) relates to a deputy manager position at a subsidiary (PPPRA), not a board membership at NNPC itself. No credible news reports support the claim. Thus, the evidence clearly refutes the claim.

`refuted`

